    "transformations": "Reversed the stored mean grip force sign to make compression positive. Used paired past force, motion, scalp EEG and surface EMG windows from the stored clocks. Fit person-weighted ridge heads on six training people and scored fixed parameters on a separate three-person development group."
  },
